<title>DENMARK: Carlsberg full year 95/96 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Carlsberg full year 95/96 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to end-Sept 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Net result after minorities 1.063 billion	  vs  1.003 billion Group pre-tax result	  1.570 billion crowns vs  1.420 billion Group net turnover	   17.965 billion crowns vs 17.072 billion Group operating result	1.252 billion crowns vs  1.212 billion  </p>
<p>Proposed dividend (percent)  unchanged 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish brewery group is Carlsberg A/S. It said in a statement that it expected possible periods of downsswing in coming years. The result was only slightly above analyst expectations.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
